SUMMARY:Mix\, Mingle and the NBA Finals (Knicks vs Spurs) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nPlease join us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **NBA F
 inals\; New York Knicks vs San Antonio Spurs**\n\n\\*Joined by my other so
 cial groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of fr
 iendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**\\*Meet us inside Smoke Sho
 w between 8:00 pm and 9:00 pm**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\
 nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Mix\, Mingle and th
 e NBA Finals (Knicks vs Spurs)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with frie
 nds\, food and the NBA Finals\n-Pool Table\, and food specials too\n-Plent
 y of parking all around the venue\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n-Arrive any 
 time between 8:00 pm and 9:00 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look for St
 eve/Organizer when you arrive)\n(1 minute walk from the new Eglinton stati
 on at Mt. Pleasant-or simply take bus or uber from the station)\n\n-Plenty
  of parking all around the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Station\n\
 n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\n
 or e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemmi
 ng11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please to support the
  staff and restaurant)\n\\*Plan to join us for dinner and the game!
