SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday June 11th
 ) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 These are songs I have written and produced for your listening pleasure. S
 oul nourishment with other like minded listeners.\n\n\\*You are welcome to
  join us any time after 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcome to
  come on later in the evening as well\n\\*\\*If it's your first time atten
 ding- come for free if you like (if you've been out before- please make a 
 small contribution to support the evening and the music)\n\nEvent Details 
 below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist
 )\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve 
 Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original l
 yrics and fully produced songs by Songwriter and Lyricist Steve Flemming\n
 \n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, spiritual songs\, and many other fun surpr
 ises!\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a fusion of mixed genres lik
 e\, So please sit back and get ready to have an amazing auditory experienc
 e in the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and off at any
  time during the night- starting at 9:00 pm\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n*
 *Event Fee:**\n\nFree if it's your first time attending online with me :)\
 n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer o
 r pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribu
 te is greatly appreciated to help support this meaningful musical endeavor
  and song loving community\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j
 /495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-
